gomodel:6ab067da00014325
        a                      owl:Ontology ;
        rdfs:comment           "Curated with GO AI HUB. STC1 inhibition of PAPPA/PAPPA2 blocks IGFBP4/IGFBP5 proteolysis and IGF1 release, negatively regulating IGF1R signaling (Human)." , "STC1 inhibits the pappalysins PAPPA (non-covalent, Ki 68 pM; no Cys120 equivalent) and PAPPA2, preventing IGFBP4/IGFBP5 cleavage and release of IGF1 for IGF1R. Core evidence PMID:26195635 (full text; human recombinant proteins, 293-IGF1R stimulation assay with IGF-I/IGFBP4/PAPPA/STC1). PAPPA2 arm: inhibition shown in vitro on IGFBP5; effect on IGF1R signaling inferred (IC). IGFBP5 sequestering of IGF1 is IC from IGF-I binding (PMID:10766744, abstract only). Not modelled: STC1 mitochondrial/LRP2, AMPK-UCP2, IGF2R, L-channel arms. Built by claude4go from Swiss-Prot PAM_STC1.log." ;
        lego:conforms_to_gpad  false ;
        lego:modelstate        "development" ;
        dc:contributor         "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7646-0052" ;
        dc:date                "2026-11-11" ;
        dc:title               "Negative regulation of IGF1R signaling by STC1 (Human)" ;
        pav:providedBy         "http://geneontology.org" ;
        owl:versionIRI         gomodel:6ab067da00014325 ;
        biolink:in_taxon       obo:NCBITaxon_9606 .

